{%- comment -%} SYNOR — collection header (H1) styles. Rendered after sa-css so it wins. {%- endcomment -%}
<style>
#shopify-section-{{ sid }} .sahd{position:relative;overflow:hidden;text-align:left;
  margin:0 0 {{ s.head_gap }}px;
  padding:{{ s.head_pad_y }}px {{ s.head_pad_x }}px {{ s.head_pad_y | minus: 4 }}px;
  border-radius:{{ s.head_radius }}px;
  background:linear-gradient(178deg,
    color-mix(in srgb,var(--hacc) {{ s.head_wash }}%,{{ s.c_page }}),
    color-mix(in srgb,var(--hacc) {{ s.head_wash | times: 0.42 | round }}%,{{ s.c_page }}) 100%)}
#shopify-section-{{ sid }} .sahd.sableed{width:100vw;max-width:100vw;
  margin-left:calc(50% - 50vw);margin-right:calc(50% - 50vw);border-radius:0;
  padding-left:{{ s.side | plus: 4 }}px;padding-right:{{ s.side | plus: 4 }}px}
#shopify-section-{{ sid }} .sahin{position:relative;z-index:2;max-width:{{ s.maxw }}px;margin:0 auto}

#shopify-section-{{ sid }} .sahwm{position:absolute;right:{{ s.wm_head_right }}px;top:{{ s.wm_head_top }}px;z-index:1;
  font-family:var(--figs,"Fraunces",Georgia,serif);font-weight:{{ s.wm_head_weight }};
  font-size:{{ s.wm_head_size }}px;line-height:.8;letter-spacing:-.02em;text-transform:uppercase;
  color:var(--hacc);opacity:{{ s.wm_head_op | divided_by: 100.0 }};pointer-events:none;user-select:none;
  white-space:nowrap}

{%- comment -%}
  The eyebrow is a flex block, not inline-flex. As an inline box it sat on the
  baseline of a line box sized by the section's inherited line-height, which put
  roughly 12px of leading above a 10px line — space no padding setting can reach.
  width:fit-content keeps it hugging its own text the way inline-flex did.
{%- endcomment -%}
#shopify-section-{{ sid }} .sahd .sakick{display:flex;width:fit-content;line-height:1.2;
  align-items:center;gap:7px;
  font-size:{{ s.kick_size }}px;letter-spacing:.24em;text-transform:uppercase;
  color:var(--hacc);font-weight:600;margin:0}
#shopify-section-{{ sid }} .sahd .sakick::before{content:"";width:16px;height:1px;background:var(--hacc);opacity:.6}
#shopify-section-{{ sid }} .sahd h2{font-family:var(--figs,"Fraunces",Georgia,serif);font-weight:500;
  font-size:{{ s.h_size }}px;line-height:1.04;letter-spacing:-.02em;margin:{{ s.kick_gap }}px 0 0;
  color:{{ s.c_ink }}}
#shopify-section-{{ sid }} .sahd .sasub{margin:8px 0 0;font-size:{{ s.sub_size }}px;line-height:1.6;
  color:{{ s.c_soft }};max-width:34ch;font-weight:300}
#shopify-section-{{ sid }} .sahd .sacnt{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;margin-top:13px;
  font-size:{{ s.cnt_size }}px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--hacc);font-weight:600;
  background:rgba(255,255,255,.72);
  border:1px solid color-mix(in srgb,var(--hacc) 26%,transparent);
  padding:5px 11px;border-radius:100px}
#shopify-section-{{ sid }} .sahd .sacnt i{width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--hacc);display:block}

{%- comment -%}
  The gender tabs when they are not the chosen one. sa-collbar.liquid paints
  .sagt-t in c_faint, which is 2.34:1 against the page — under the 4.5:1 AA asks
  for at 9.5px. Its sheet is emitted after this one, so these rules carry the
  section id to outrank it, and :not(.on) so the chosen tab keeps its own ink.
{%- endcomment -%}
#shopify-section-{{ sid }} .sagt-t:not(.on){color:{{ s.c_soft }}}
#shopify-section-{{ sid }} .sagt-t:not(.on) .sagt-c .fp{opacity:.55}

{%- comment -%}
  The collection description: two lines on a phone, three from 900, with a
  toggle on the end of the last one. The clamp is CSS only, so the full text
  stays in the markup; the checkbox is off-screen but still focusable, and the
  label carries real words rather than ::after content so a screen reader
  announces the state.
{%- endcomment -%}
#shopify-section-{{ sid }} .sahd .sasub-t{position:absolute;width:1px;height:1px;opacity:0;margin:0;pointer-events:none}
#shopify-section-{{ sid }} .sahd .sasub-w{position:relative;margin:8px 0 0;
  font-size:{{ s.sub_size }}px;max-width:34ch}
#shopify-section-{{ sid }} .sahd .sasub-w .sasub{margin:0;max-width:none}
#shopify-section-{{ sid }} .sahd .sasub-clamp{display:-webkit-box;-webkit-box-orient:vertical;
  -webkit-line-clamp:2;line-clamp:2;overflow:hidden}
#shopify-section-{{ sid }} .sahd .sasub-t:checked ~ .sasub-w .sasub-clamp{display:block;overflow:visible}

{%- comment -%}
  Collapsed, the toggle is laid on the right end of the last visible line and
  costs no height. The strip it sits on fades in from the band's own colour at
  zero alpha, so the words it covers dissolve rather than meeting an edge; the
  band's gradient has all but landed on its end colour by the time it reaches
  this line, which is what the 42% here matches. ::before widens the tap target
  above and below without moving anything. Opened, it returns to the flow and
  takes a line of its own, which by then is a line the reader asked for.
{%- endcomment -%}
#shopify-section-{{ sid }} .sahd .sasub-m{position:absolute;right:0;bottom:0;z-index:2;cursor:pointer;
  font-size:{{ s.sub_size }}px;line-height:1.6;font-weight:600;color:var(--hacc);
  text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px;
  padding-left:38px;
  background:linear-gradient(90deg,
    {{ s.c_page | color_modify: 'alpha', 0 }},
    color-mix(in srgb,var(--hacc) {{ s.head_wash | times: 0.42 | round }}%,{{ s.c_page }}) 58%);
  -webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent}
#shopify-section-{{ sid }} .sahd .sasub-m::before{content:"";position:absolute;inset:-7px -4px -7px 0}
#shopify-section-{{ sid }} .sahd .sasub-less{display:none}
#shopify-section-{{ sid }} .sahd .sasub-t:checked ~ .sasub-w .sasub-m{position:relative;
  background:none;padding-left:0;margin-top:4px;display:inline-block}
#shopify-section-{{ sid }} .sahd .sasub-t:checked ~ .sasub-w .sasub-m .sasub-more{display:none}
#shopify-section-{{ sid }} .sahd .sasub-t:checked ~ .sasub-w .sasub-m .sasub-less{display:inline}
#shopify-section-{{ sid }} .sahd .sasub-t:focus-visible ~ .sasub-w .sasub-m{outline:2px solid var(--hacc);outline-offset:3px}

@supports not (background: color-mix(in srgb,red 20%,blue)){
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .sahd{background:{{ s.c_page }}}
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .sahd .sacnt{border-color:{{ s.c_gold2 }}}
}
@media(min-width:900px){
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .sahd{padding-top:{{ s.head_pad_y | plus: 14 }}px;
    padding-bottom:{{ s.head_pad_y | plus: 6 }}px}
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .sahd h2{font-size:{{ s.h_size | plus: 10 }}px}
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .sahd .sasub-clamp{-webkit-line-clamp:3;line-clamp:3}
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} .sahwm{font-size:{{ s.wm_head_size | plus: 28 }}px}
}
</style>
